# The Hakoniwa Drone x500 (sensor model v2) for the official ArduCopter V4.7.2 Pixhawk4 firmware on Athrill STM32
# (docs/hakoniwa.md, "ArduPilot"). NAME,VALUE in ArduCopter 4.7 names and units. run.sh writes it once over MAVLink.
